12. Conclusion

The Student Learning Portal demonstrates the practical use of Object-Oriented Programming in Python to solve a problem in education. It applies classes, objects, attributes, methods and a list data structure to manage student learning records while considering accessibility, privacy, modularity and open-source sharing.
